OL,3,ARare pink diamond goes on display in
OL,4,AFrance 100 years after amateur heist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare pink diamond is going on display
OL,7,Fin France for the first time since it
OL,8,Fwas stolen almost 100 years ago to the
OL,9,Fday - the last time it was shown to the
OL,10,Fpublic.
OL,12,FThe nine-carat, pear-shaped gemstone
OL,13,Fknown as the "Grand Conde" was pilfered
OL,14,Fin an overnight raid on the Chateau de
OL,15,FChantilly in October 1926 and concealed
OL,16,Fin a hollowed-out apple.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
