OL,3,ARare pink diamond goes on display in
OL,4,AFrance 100 years after amateur heist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe diamond - one of few royal jewels
OL,7,Fto survive the French Revolution - was
OL,8,Frecovered a few weeks later when a
OL,9,Fhungry maid at the hotel in which the
OL,10,Fthieves were staying took a bite of the
OL,11,Fapple.
OL,13,FIt will once again be on display in the
OL,14,FConde Museum at the Chateau de
OL,15,FChantilly until 3 January.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
